Chart 2 lists the values of the classification bins and the total traffic volume accumulated for each bin.
CLASSIFICATION
Most of the vehicles classified during the study were Vans & Pickups. The number of Passenger Vehicles in
the study was 179 which represents 23 percent of the total classified vehicles. The number of Vans &
Pickups in the study was 463 which represents 60 percent of the total classified vehicles. The number of
Busses & Trucks in the study was 79 which represents 10 percent of the total classified vehicles. The
number of Tractor Trailers in the study was 50 which represents 6 percent of the total classified vehicles.
