During the peak traffic period, on 06/01/2021 at [05:00 PM-05:15 PM] the average headway between
vehicles was 27.273 seconds. During the slowest traffic period, on 06/01/2021 at [11:30 PM-11:45 PM] the
average headway between vehicles was 900 seconds.
